        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-26T06:29:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It is confirmed in the Letters page podcast that Christopher and Adam do that the two are indeed connected in that they are both Singular Entities, aka they are creatures that exist on some upper plane and are unique in the multiverse, meaning there is only one of them.</p>\n<p>Wager master also semi-actively opposes Oblivaeon durring the final fight. For the most part though he isn't really involved. He is characterized as an attention seeking younger brother who feels upstaged by his less-fun reletive, OblivAeon.</p>\n<p>Here is a link to the wager master&nbsp;episode if you like. There is more in other episodes.&nbsp;http://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-41-wager-master&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hope this helps.&nbsp;</p>",
